{"id":"vod_sn_36280","vodId":"36280","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","name_cn":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e3dde365ba03a86e5abb32d2397ba17a.jpg"},"summary":"在寒冷的北海道旭川市某处，生活着以美人自居的大小姐九条樱子（伊藤静 配音）。除了有些自恋外，樱子还有用死尸骨头制作标本的怪癖，其对于验尸更有着较深的学识。也许正是对尸体、骨骼那有着近乎偏执的异乎寻常的喜爱，让樱子接二连三卷入各种匪夷所思的死亡事件中。在此过程中，普通高中生馆胁正太郎（榎木淳弥 配音）也被樱子牵着鼻子跑来跑去，见证着每一个案件被侦破的瞬间。对于死者来说，恰恰因为有了樱子这样的怪人，才让他们的冤屈得以昭雪……　　本片根据太田紫织的同名轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QgfXRug50H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ziDv1QbuF81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5iHtx1qtGP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jUKtEafk3w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AcqPc6fvPH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n27W0RBUYx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JyyFdVUEYj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QwBK0YyJmw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hC9Qz2NmvF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fx3g7LzpTQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KMA3F02gdT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uugqqTd6MD1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.768Z"}